  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "櫥窗與展售空間",
    "sub_ename": "SHOP WINDOW AND RETAIL SPACE",
    "describe_ch": "櫥窗的視覺陳列直接提升商品價值，也展露出對外宣示該品牌及空間的視覺美學及品牌性格。空間不再只是千篇一律的陳列，商業空間注重視覺美學，追求整體空間的美學系統，建構出獨特的空間格調。 櫥窗陳列概念精神、商品陳列基本美學、視覺企畫案規劃、燈光與材料運用等面向，本課程與同學解紹透過專業美學設計，驅動強烈購物慾望的展示空間與櫥窗規劃。",
    "describe_eh": "The visual display of the window directly enhances the value of the product, and also reveals the visual aesthetics and brand personality of the brand and space. Space is no longer just a one-size-fits-all display. The commercial space focuses on visual aesthetics, pursuing the aesthetic system of the overall space, and constructing a unique spatial style. The concept of window display concept, the basic aesthetics of merchandise display, the planning of visual planning, the use of lighting and materials, etc., this course and students explain the display space and window planning of strong shopping desire through professional aesthetic design.",
